# The harness writes these itself, always with LF (newline="\n"): the
# Harbour reference outputs, the tables and the extracted tests. Checked out
# as CRLF under core.autocrlf, every run rewrote them in another form than
# git had written — "LF will be replaced by CRLF" on each, and a file
# (hbref/own_process.txt) that git status kept calling modified with no
# difference in it. As LF on both sides a rewrite is byte for byte what
# git checked out.
hbref/*.txt       text eol=lf
generated/*.prg   text eol=lf
manifest.tsv      text eol=lf
status.tsv        text eol=lf
